  + `markDispatchIntent(...,'failed')`); (b) **out-of-band** reaper for stale RUNNING (Vercel
  Cron/pg_cron/Supabase Edge — NOT another inngest fn, they die with inngest); (c) finish
  provider timeouts in `anthropic-brief.ts:141` + `anthropic-vision.ts:54` (reuse
